    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect Hand of Nostalpix is a remaster of the 1989 digital card game classic. Defeat your foes with a deck you tweaked to perfection by collecting, upgrading and evolving each card, in this blast from the past enhanced with new mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345540/extras/c446cb402ad6224e0c9217b132d5eb90.poster.avif?t=1739395878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345540/extras/c446cb402ad6224e0c9217b132d5eb90.gif?t=1739395878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa SET IN THE SAME UNIVERSE CARD NOVA HYPER \u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloth-<strong>exploding</strong> dramatic card game, wishlist now and follow us on Kickstarter!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DOMINATE YOUR OPPONENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the game mechanics and plan using cunning strategies to trap your opponents and destroy them with the power of your monsters, orbs and runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the best possible deck across the cards in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your monsters while paying attention to their runes. Find the best objects to enhance your current strategy, and nothing can stand in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponder which card to upgrade, evolve, and awake. Customize their effects with powerful runes, seeking the best synergies that fits your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All to reach the perfect hand of Nostalpix.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect Hand of Nostalpix is a remaster of the 1989 digital card game classic. Defeat your foes with a deck you tweaked to perfection by collecting, upgrading and evolving each card, in this blast from the past enhanced with new mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345540/extras/c446cb402ad6224e0c9217b132d5eb90.poster.avif?t=1739395878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345540/extras/c446cb402ad6224e0c9217b132d5eb90.gif?t=1739395878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa SET IN THE SAME UNIVERSE CARD NOVA HYPER \u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa\u25aa </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloth-<strong>exploding</strong> dramatic card game, wishlist now and follow us on Kickstarter!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DOMINATE YOUR OPPONENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the game mechanics and plan using cunning strategies to trap your opponents and destroy them with the power of your monsters, orbs and runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the best possible deck across the cards in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your monsters while paying attention to their runes. Find the best objects to enhance your current strategy, and nothing can stand in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponder which card to upgrade, evolve, and awake. Customize their effects with powerful runes, seeking the best synergies that fits your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All to reach the perfect hand of Nostalpix.</p>",
